  "finding": "Ten native two-handed twinblade/katana chakram entries select generic horizontal arm-slash clips. Five one-handed rapier entries already select item-translating Simply Swords throws, visible in both owner and TCP observer captures. Five sai entries have no native Better Combat melee profile and remain vanilla-swing controls. All sixteen physical right-click trials already travel out and return for both clients.",
